                       fix: give your user access to /dev/uinput
  warn ydotool         ydotool is not installed
                       fix: install ydotool 1.x
  warn idle time       no idle source; activity is simulated on a fixed schedule
                       fix: install xprintidle for idle-aware simulation
  warn screen lock     cannot tell when the screen is locked
                       fix: activity keeps running while the screen is locked; on Linux this needs logind or org.freedesktop.ScreenSaver
